# A Good Day to Die may target any creature. Bot2's Ornithopter gets +2/+0 and Bot1 bolts it: "you draw a card" is
# Bot1's delayed ability (CR 603.7d: controlled by the spell's controller), so Bot1 - not the Ornithopter's owner -
# draws, and Bot2's library is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
A Good Day to Die
Lightning Bolt
Island x3
Island
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Swamp x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.A Good Day to Die.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Library.Count = 12
Bot1.Hand = Guerrilla Gorilla; Island; Island; Island; Island
